🧠 3. GitHub README (you MUST include this)

Here’s your starter README:

# FirstSeat 🚀

FirstSeat is an early-access marketplace where users can reserve spots in upcoming projects, apps, and communities before they launch.

## 💡 What it does
- Discover upcoming digital projects
- Reserve early access spots
- Pay small entry fees
- Unlock rewards and founder perks

## 🧱 Tech Stack
- React Native (or Flutter)
- Firebase (Auth + Database)
- Stripe (Payments)

## 📱 Core Features
- Early access listings
- Project reservation system
- Secure payments
- User “My Spots” dashboard
- Creator project posting

## 🚀 Status
MVP in development

🔥 4. GitHub Workflow (how you actually build it)

Don’t just dump code — build in this order:
Phase 1 (Core App)

* Auth system
* Home feed
* Project list
* Project details

Phase 2 (Money flow)

* Payment integration (Stripe)
* Commitments table
* Success screen

Phase 3 (Retention)

* My Spots screen
* Notifications
* Rewards system

Phase 4 (Creators)

* Create project screen
* Admin dashboard

